  "description": "SUBVUJ crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C22 H72 Cr2 Gd5 O41 7+,7(Cl1 O4 1-),33(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Cr1 (Cr) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2B (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd3B (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Cr1B (Cr) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 11 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.448-4.589 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.02-137.03°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd5Cr2(H2L)2(OAc)6(μ3-OH)6(H2O)15](ClO4)7·33H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 6 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 15 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
